    "synthetic": false,
    "summary": "The Pakistan Monument in Islamabad: four large granite petals for the four cultures and three smaller petals for the territories, converging over a star-shaped central platform, with the museum and Freedom Plaza beside them. The petal form, counts, height and dates are documented; the curve of the petals, the star and the plaza are a reconstruction."
  },
