      "rights": "reference_only",
      "ref": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pakistan_Monument - national monument and heritage museum on the Shakarparian Hills; designed by Arif Masoud, selected 10 July 2003, foundation 25 May 2004, completed 2006, inaugurated 23 March 2007; height 18 m; area 2.8 hectares; four large petals for the four cultures and three smaller petals for the minorities, Azad Kashmir and Gilgit-Baltistan; granite petals, black granite star, stainless steel crescent; museum and Freedom Plaza."
    },
